+### ECON-02B2d15 (local prototype; 2026-11-01)
+
+The colony controls support owner-authorized two-stage workshop shutdown and NPC-managed evacuation of real workshop goods into the original built storage bin. WIP drains before operator release; the worker carries at most 20 kg per trip; inventory custody, restart recovery and resource-ledger receipts are authoritative. CTest 105/105 and JavaScript 93/93 passed locally on Linux, plus two offline Chromium UI tests. See [`docs/engineering/ECON02B2d15_Production_Line_Shutdown_And_NPC_Evacuation_2026-11-01.md`](docs/engineering/ECON02B2d15_Production_Line_Shutdown_And_NPC_Evacuation_2026-11-01.md) for tests, limits and remaining Windows/3D gates.
